{"id":"f101d6e81c79b239","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map.md","title":"ZFC Model7 Comparison Map","display":"df-zfc-model7-comparison-map — ZFC Model7 Comparison Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map"],"display":"df-zfc-model7-comparison-map — ZFC Model7 Comparison Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model7-comparison-map — ZFC Model7 Comparison Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\">\\(i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is the metasyntactic predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> is therefore metasyntactic</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S(i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta,\nR_T,R_U,\\vec M_T,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_T,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_T,\\vec i_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal M,\\alpha+1)\n\\land\\mathcal T=\\langle\\alpha+1,R_T,\\vec M_T,\\vec E_T,\\vec i_T\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal N,\\beta+1)\n\\land\\mathcal U=\\langle\\beta+1,R_U,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_U\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\vec M_T(\\alpha)=\\vec M_U(\\beta)\n\\land i=\\vec i_T(\\langle0,\\alpha\\rangle)\n\\land j=\\vec i_U(\\langle0,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S(i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta,\nR_T,R_U,\\vec M_T,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_T,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_T,\\vec i_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal M,\\alpha+1)\n\\land\\mathcal T=\\langle\\alpha+1,R_T,\\vec M_T,\\vec E_T,\\vec i_T\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal N,\\beta+1)\n\\land\\mathcal U=\\langle\\beta+1,R_U,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_U\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\vec M_T(\\alpha)=\\vec M_U(\\beta)\n\\land i=\\vec i_T(\\langle0,\\alpha\\rangle)\n\\land j=\\vec i_U(\\langle0,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both maps are extracted from the components certified by the two iteration-tree predicates, and their terminal models coincide.</li>\n<li>Because the current iteration-tree atom explicitly leaves the fine-structural extender-ultrapower step at the metalevel, this comparison predicate necessarily inherits that status.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ is the metasyntactic predicate from [[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S:V^4\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model7\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}map}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel7ComparisonMap}_S(i,j,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\alpha,\\beta,\nR_T,R_U,\\vec M_T,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_T,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_T,\\vec i_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,\\mathcal M,\\alpha+1)\n\\land\\mathcal T=\\langle\\alpha+1,R_T,\\vec M_T,\\vec E_T,\\vec i_T\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal U,\\mathcal N,\\beta+1)\n\\land\\mathcal U=\\langle\\beta+1,R_U,\\vec M_U,\\vec E_U,\\vec i_U\\rangle\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\vec M_T(\\alpha)=\\vec M_U(\\beta)\n\\land i=\\vec i_T(\\langle0,\\alpha\\rangle)\n\\land j=\\vec i_U(\\langle0,\\beta\\rangle)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1674,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2775","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map.md|58-df-zfc-model7-comparison-map]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","92fbda0605a6cb98"]}